	"details": "",
	"flavor": "NSLOCTEXT(\"[D20C99C24B2FABB4DC05E3BF1EE067C5]\", \"CEDC5E204B9E19159E7CC3A5A65E7587\", \"Wreathed in embers and crowned with flame-kissed plumage, the Phoenix Gryphon blazes across the skies above Sunhaven like a living omen of rebirth and wrath. Its leonine frame radiates heat with every bound, while its wings unfurl in a brilliant flare of copper and gold, trailing sparks that never fall. Forged in volcanic storms and tempered by centuries of wildfire, it carries with it the legacy of survival through ruin and triumph through trial. A creature of myth made manifest, the Phoenix Gryphon symbolizes more than strength and leadership; it is the embodiment of relentless resurgence. Only the Mayor of Sunhaven may claim its loyalty, for only one who has endured fire without being consumed may ride such a mount.\")",
